{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oops! A monkey has stolen your blown-out wig.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you want to make it to your blind date tonight, use your umbrella to defeat the wind and obstacles and get your wig back!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795300/extras/umbrella-3.png?t=1749594720\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795300/extras/\uc6b0\uc0b0GIF.gif?t=1749594720\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control your umbrella as it flails in the wind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful, it will fly backwards if you leave a certain angle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795300/extras/umbrella-4.png?t=1749594720\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795300/extras/\uc7a5\uc560\ubb3cGIF.gif?t=1749594720\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump over the many obstacles that stand in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It won't be easy, but you can do it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795300/extras/umbrella-5.png?t=1749594720\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795300/extras/\uc801GIF.gif?t=1749594720\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monkey-obsessed villains (or artists!) stand in your way! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face a variety of terrain and enemy patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795300/extras/umbrella-6.png?t=1749594720\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795300/extras/\uc544\uc774\ud15cGIF.gif?t=1749594720\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't worry, you're not alone! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each time you reach a certain distance, you'll be rewarded with a powerful item.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u203bOn the demo version, you can only play Stage 1.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3795300?t=1749594720","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3795300?t=1749594720","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795300/1f801c95a45143e8bd1464bb8da3271f0cb22653/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749594720","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795300/1f801c95a45143e8bd1464bb8da3271f0cb22653/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749594720","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oops! A monkey has stolen your blown-out wig.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you want to make it to your blind date tonight, use your umbrella to defeat the wind and obstacles and get your wig back!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795300/extras/umbrella-3.png?t=1749594720\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795300/extras/\uc6b0\uc0b0GIF.gif?t=1749594720\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control your umbrella as it flails in the wind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful, it will fly backwards if you leave a certain angle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=